{
 "encounter_id": "00854",
 "speakers": {
  "person_1": "PATIENT",
  "person_2": "DOCTOR"
 },
 "turns": [
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "Right. I'm here because my partner says I've got a temper, and I need to sort it. I don't want to lose my job."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "Thank you for coming. Tell me what's been happening."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "I get short with people. At work, at home. Small things, someone leaves a door open, and I blow. I shout. Then I feel terrible."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "How long has this been going on?"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "A year? Maybe longer. I can't say when it started. It got worse after Christmas."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "Has anything changed in your life? ~"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "A new boss. A new baby, eight months ago. I'm not sleeping, and money's tight. ~"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "How's your sleep?"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "Four hours a night, broken."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "Any thoughts of harming yourself, or anyone else?"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "No. No, I'd never. Not anyone."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "What are you taking?"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "Propranolol, 10 mg, when I feel wound up, but not sure it does anything. Something for my stomach, omeprazole, 20 mg. And I take St John's wort, maybe 300 mg, a day."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "I need to stop you there, because St John's wort interacts with a lot of drugs. So it's 300 mg, as you recall it. Any other conditions?"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "Acid reflux. That's all."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "Do you drink, or use any substances?"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "A few beers at night, to switch off. Four, five. And lots of coffee."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "And what do you do for exercise, or to relax?"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "Nothing. No time."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "Let me check your pulse and blood pressure. ~"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "Fine. ~"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "Pulse 84, blood pressure 138 over 88.",
   "pause": 10.0
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "Is that okay? ~"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "Slightly raised, which fits with stress and the alcohol. Any breathlessness, chest pain?"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "No."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "Right. Putting this together, irritability and outbursts for a year, poor sleep, a new baby, work stress and heavy-ish drinking, I'd say this is stress-related irritability, probably with sleep deprivation and alcohol feeding it."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "Is that all? I thought I might be bipolar or something. ~"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "Nothing you've described points that way. But I'd like to check your thyroid and a few other things, because they can cause irritability."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "Okay. ~"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "Cut the beer to a couple of units, not every night, and stop the St John's wort, it can interact with other things. Cut the coffee after midday."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "Right. ~"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "And I'd like you to try a short anger-management course, and talking therapy."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "Will that help? ~"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "It does, for most. I'd like to see you again in three weeks."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "Three weeks. Thanks. ~"
  }
 ],
